# cinematic_shot_set|start|end|id|label|heroLandmarksCsv|vistaLandmarksCsv|lightingId|cameraShotId|terrainMaterialId|fogMood|compositionNotes
# wave|editorGuid|displayName|triggerRailDistance|prewarmDistance|timeoutSeconds|completionCondition|executionPolicy|nextWaveGuid|triggerEventId|enabled|editorVisible|editorLocked
